{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2018-07", "window": 3, "start_date": 1531699200, "end_date": 1532390399, "month_true_total": 63, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:55:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "43688934", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158396003", "personaname": "☪ Sheik Yerbouti ☪", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thepremierezappaneer/", "num_games_owned": 760, "num_reviews": 358, "playtime_forever": 1154, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1154, "deck_playtime_at_review": 122, "last_played": 1750608038, "avatar": "832a30612d40dea94a9d425b9856829d565d66ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Relic seems to think that slapping a new name on an old game and making ZERO changes somehow makes it 40 ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ dollars.  Little do they know, it doesn't. It's also the same ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ price as the remaster now, which gives you even less a reason to play that piece of ♥♥♥♥. No matter what though, it's still mediocre.", "timestamp_created": 1532299747, "timestamp_updated": 1768702705, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43671766", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979671648", "personaname": "Thaiden", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197979671648/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 4822, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4082, "last_played": 1682764891, "avatar": "a762218101b8c35dae79bffde0262855b5b8c036"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the better Warhammer 40k shooters.\n-Fun with friends\n-Good solo campaign\n-Solid gameplay\n-Multiplayer can be laggy if host does not have good connection to you\n\nWorth a buy if you want some 40k action, especially on sale\n8/10", "timestamp_created": 1532225118, "timestamp_updated": 1532225118, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43662642", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353212142", "personaname": "Magmatic Fish", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198353212142/", "num_games_owned": 650, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 17239, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5245, "last_played": 1725275252, "avatar": "465be402b99f30e1a139dff97255df2a354be95a"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you like dispatching an Ork's severed head, or even placing a traitor where he... It... Belongs in the name of the Emprah.\nThen, uh...\nThen bloody buy, m8.", "timestamp_created": 1532184034, "timestamp_updated": 1532184034, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497186422348022461", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43636256", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010307537", "personaname": "nholmes", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010307537/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 358, "last_played": 1532060135, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Terrible, Love the world that they built but the mechanics of this game and the way that they are implemented are too frustrating to continue.  I haven't had a single session go by without yelling at the system.  Stay for the Thunder Hammer then uninstall when you can't take any more and you will be happier for it.  \nTo the developers, If you want us to heal by taking on hordes of enemies, feeling like a warrior god, than for the Emperor's sake don't kill us in the middle of the execution animation making us feel like the worthless whelps surrounding these walking tanks.  ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ is what it is frankly.  Great work on the basis, now go back, play arkham and shadow to get the sense of being able to lay waste to groups of enemies with ease, the player sharing in the experience of pure power.  better yet, battle royale with chaos marines.  You're welcome.", "timestamp_created": 1532060544, "timestamp_updated": 1532060544, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.422596156597137451", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43617779", "author": {"steamid": "76561198153583728", "personaname": "Elrix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198153583728/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 121, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 121, "last_played": 1479190982, "avatar": "cf7d4c3d93a5a557f2d5c53396127f038737c8df"}, "language": "english", "review": "the game got repedative really fast. It was one direction and a repetition of the same few combos over and over. Storyline seemed ok. Buy you can buy something better.", "timestamp_created": 1531976942, "timestamp_updated": 1531976942, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.444699764251708984", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refun